	<section_number>8.01-196</section_number>
	<catch_line>Comptroller to institute proceedings</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Comptroller shall institute and prosecute all proceedings proper to enforce payment of money to the Commonwealth.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 8-758; 1977, c. 617.</history>
